CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

REGENT OF BANDUNG,

Considering : a. that in order to improve the position, role and quality of women is an effort to realize gender equality and justice in family, social, national and state life;

